<title>USA: Nassau County, NY plans $155 mln bond sale in Feb.</title>
<headline>Nassau County, NY plans $155 mln bond sale in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nassau County, New York, plans to sell approximately $155 million of general obligation bonds on February 27, a county official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official, who declined to be named, said that the bonds would be sold competitively, adding the final details, including the exact amount, remained to be worked out.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
